    "application": "BambuStudio-02.08.02.60",
    "profile_title": "Symmetrical Corners 0.2mm layer, 2 walls, 5% infill",
    "profile_notes": "This print profile provides a modified, perfectly symmetric version of the original model. What's Changed: Perfect Symmetry: To ensure the pattern is completely balanced, I extracted exactly 1/4 of the original model and mirrored it across the axes to generate the remaining three quadrants. Unified Corner Style: By using this precise mirroring technique, all four corners now share the exact same edge style and segment pattern, resolving the asymmetry found in the original design. Seamless Alignment: The four individual pieces have been carefully aligned on the build plate. Please note that while they are not merged using the software's Assemble function, their coordinates are matched perfectly so they will slice and print seamlessly as a single, cohesive object. Printing Notes: Slicer Preview: Before sending it to the printer, I highly recommend checking the first layer in your slicer's Preview tab just to verify that the seams where the four quadrants meet are tight and continuous. Standard printing parameters apply. Happy printing!",
